<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PPC half year EPS drops 11 pct, div held.</title>
<headline>PPC half year EPS drops 11 pct, div held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 201.9	 vs 226.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 85.0	  vs 85.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   89.1	  vs 97.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   138.3	 vs 142.7</p>
<p>    Tax			 49.2	  vs 45.7</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   5.0	   vs 3.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		  830.0	 vs 688.4</p>
<p>Div payable July 1</p>
<p>on register May 30</p>
<p>Full name: Pretoria Portland Cement Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast EPS of 232.52, with the range 221.6-240.0, and a dividend of 84.8, with the range 82.0-87.0.</p>
<p>The results had been expected on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
